      "cooked": "<p>For those watching / interested and not worried about spoilers...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>LUKE CAGE!!!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Finished it a few minutes ago.&nbsp;![](upload://fySPYAyUqExEaFrjtsIiAE6aRPv.gif) Yeah, it's been a long, awesome weekend (about to end with SotM gaming with some friends). I'm going to have to digest for a bit, but I was really impressed, overall. It had some issues, mostly related to it's comic book nature and approach, but the messages were really well crafted and it's characters (with one exception, in my mind) beautifully done.</p><p>What is everyone else thinking?</p>",
